&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;AI with a Soul:&amp;nbsp;Guardrails, Access, and the Future of Healthcare&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://nam02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.publichealth.columbia.edu%2Facademics%2Fdepartments%2Fhealth-policy-management%2Fnews-events%2Fhealthcare-conference&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7Cas5760%40cumc.columbia.edu%7Cc17b100202154bf4a7e708de901c3bfd%7Cb0002a9b0017404d97dc3d3bab09be81%7C0%7C0%7C639106648120758445%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=8OSTPbVAfmvHkHi3p%2BIxn79hwOnbnhs4wIevDpettXk%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0"&gt;2026 HPM Healthcare Conference&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;will focus on AI and humanity, exploring how artificial intelligence can advance healthcare while preserving equity, trust, and human-centered care. Through a keynote and morning panel, we will examine what AI can do and how it should be responsibly implemented in public health, health systems, and communities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Keynote Address will be given by&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://nam02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fin%2Fren%25C3%25A9ecummings%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7Cas5760%40cumc.columbia.edu%7Cc17b100202154bf4a7e708de901c3bfd%7Cb0002a9b0017404d97dc3d3bab09be81%7C0%7C0%7C639106648120776908%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=1D2814Y6lsdbkCdLOTigpFBLa03G67%2B7ivL8PKBY7XU%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0"&gt;Ren&amp;eacute;e Cummings&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
