&lt;p&gt;The Institute for the Study of Sexuality and Gender at Columbia University invites you to a screening of&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Nisha&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;(2025, 29min), followed by a discussion with the film&amp;#39;s director,&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Kris&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
