Kris is a Bangalore-based community organizer with over a decade of experience building safe, joyful spaces for FLINTA/LGBTQIA+ communities. She co-founded All Sorts of Queer, a support group based in Bengaluru and manages operations for Maya Bazaar, a vibrant marketplace for queer entrepreneurs. &amp;lsquo;Nisha&amp;rsquo; marks her foray into films, where she brings authenticity, warmth, and lived experience to the screen. &amp;lsquo;Nisha&amp;rsquo; was written and directed by Kris with mentoring from Mujeer Pasha and Veena Kulkarni.&lt;br /&gt;
